OmniState

Third-party material

crates/omni-core/src/design/proto.rs ports the prototype interaction types
(Trigger, Action, Transition, Easing, Interaction and their JSON names) from
FigCraft, crates/doc/src/proto.rs. crates/omni-core/src/design/devices.rs ports
its device table (PrototypeSettings::DEVICES), and proto.rs its Flow and
PrototypeSettings.

